+
+### `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`
+
+Applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386) to a JSON document.
+Object members with a `null` patch value are removed; other object members are merged recursively.
+An array, primitive, or `null` patch replaces the target wholesale. Both arguments must be JSON values,
+and the returned document is detached from both inputs.
